        <p>No third-party middleware, a fully integrated hardware and software stack delivering 99.9% inventory accuracy and one-tap checkout.</p>
        <ul class="feature-bullets">
          <li>RFID-enabled checkout: process entire baskets in seconds, no line-of-sight scanning</li>
